.png", "id": "7237945472887597", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_7237945482887596_2327625571297661666_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iCkjpqpARXwQ7kNvwF0cTIH&_nc_oc=Adl1tC7AN3ILtL2A69y8tbpGjX7qW06JFSyBFldLjIOdHw7rePfor7z-l6U7iNCLQiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxm0O8rG_n6BmZF9jGlMgazqOvOgAfoFKdkuna9TdT_aw&oe=69AAB87F"}, "display_name": "Unbuild VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Unbuild is like Jenga and Angry Birds had a baby...\"\nJared Nelson - toucharcade.com\n\nBuild turrets the other way around!\n\nHere you have 29 completed building block constructs.\nI set them all up for you by hand :-)\n\nCan you take it brick by brick\nwithout anything falling to the ground?\n\nWhich stone you can take away\ndetermined by chance!\n\nHave fun dismantling!\nYours Matthias from Klickaffen\n\nTry Unbuild VR now!\nAs part of the Klickaffen summer freshness,\nthe game is available here for free for a short time!", "short_description": "Build turrets the other way around!\nHere you have 29 completed building block constructs.\nCan you take it brick by brick\nwithout anything falling to the ground?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.klickaffen.tv/unbuild/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Matthias Mach - Klickaffen Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.klickaffen.tv/unbuild", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCUL